WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:04.390
Speaker 1: I don't know if maybe there's a
contest going on between Republican senators

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:09.880
who can appear to be the most disconnected
from the modern world and how we talk about

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.730
things in 2021.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:19.400
But if such a contest exists, I would nominate
Republican Senator John Kennedy, no relation

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.390
to the Democratic Kennedy family.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:26.240
In the last month, I brought you the story
of Senator John Kennedy strangely trying to

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:33.110
equate guns and cars, as well as kind of equating
the regulation of guns and cars.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:38.219
You can check out that segment from the March
24th Show, if it sounds interesting and it

00:00:38.219 --> 00:00:39.559
is actually pretty interesting.

00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:45.360
But yesterday, John Kennedy was on Fox News
ostensibly talking about, I guess, police

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.250
shootings and police brutality.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:56.199
And he started talking about how we quote,
higher whites, blacks and browns.

00:00:56.199 --> 00:00:59.159
It was as strange a segment as it sounds.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.159
Let's take a look.

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:01.269
Speaker 4: There's no justice.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.799
We can't have a society without it.

00:01:03.799 --> 00:01:08.990
And we have decided to hire law enforcement
officials to maintain order.

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:16.359
We hire whites, blacks, brown men, women to
maintain order.

00:01:16.359 --> 00:01:23.360
Many, many of our of our law enforcement agencies
are our majority minority.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:30.070
Speaker 1: If you want to sound like a racist
Southerner, like if you really want to play

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:37.829
the prototypical caricature of a racist American
right wing southerner, you say exactly what

00:01:37.829 --> 00:01:45.130
he said in exactly that accent, exactly how
he talks about whites, blacks and browns.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:52.079
That's how you make yourself look like the
typical caricature of a Southern racist American.

00:01:52.079 --> 00:01:57.999
In another moment, from the same appearance,
Senator Kennedy apparently in an effort to

00:01:57.999 --> 00:02:03.210
push back against the defund the police movement,
which is supported by very few people.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:07.420
He says if you don't like police next time,
call a crackhead.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.490
That's his word, not mine.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:09.870
Speaker 4: I'll put it this way.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:14.120
If you hate cops just because they're cops,
you don't know anything about them, then next

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:16.550
time you get in trouble, call a crackhead.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:24.220
Now, having said that, what we're really talking
about here, what we're talking about here

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:29.890
is the relationship between crime and race.

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:31.960
Let's just cut to the chase.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:39.970
It is a statistical fact that just as it is
the case that more men than women commit crimes,

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:46.810
just as it is a statistical fact that more
younger people than older people commit crimes,

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:53.020
we have racial minorities and ethnic groups
in America that have higher crime rates.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.910
We have to.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:03:01.310
Poverty, but that doesn't tell you anything
Speaker 1: that is a sitting United States

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:03.370
senator, if you can believe it.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:11.440
This opens up the possibility of so many skits
and satire on Saturday Night Live that they

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.780
must be thanking the comedy gods right now.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:20.930
If you don't like police, call a crackhead
next time you're in trouble.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:25.700
Why not just improve policing and then feel
better about calling the police?

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:29.540
Most people don't want to actually defund
or abolish the police.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:34.620
Why do you need to go to what we have or crackheads?

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:39.720
It's a very strange kind of backwards reverse
rationalization.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:44.740
The choices are police we don't believe are
as well-trained as they should be.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:49.640
And drug addicts like how are those the parameters
that we should be selecting between?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:55.840
And by the way, when I was preparing the segment,
I got a phone call and the clip kept playing

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.070
without sound.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:03.410
If you want to see a really a scary movie,
so to speak, watch Senator John Kennedy speaking

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.630
without the audio on.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.990
It's really the stuff of nightmares.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.390
But that's an aside.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:13.230
Now, there's like one percent that John Kennedy
gets correct here.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.800
Don't hate police for being police.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:22.720
Most police officers are people who are choosing
to be police officers for admirable, good

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:27.950
reasons and who never have complaints against
them about use of force.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.060
It would be bad.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:36.280
It would be a non-thinking reason to hate
an individual officer because they are a police

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:38.740
officer at the same time.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:43.180
And this is where, you know, it's almost like
they can't hold two ideas simultaneously.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:52.060
At the same time, you can understand that
all officers can be part of a system that

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:59.900
is not productively serving a large portion
of the people in their respective communities

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:03.530
and that there are changes there that need
to be made.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.510
None of it involves crackheads.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.440
None of it involves drug addicts of any kind.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:15.930
Now, I know that the caricature is the left
just wants to end police or defund the police

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:17.400
or cancel police or whatever.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.650
There are some who want to do that.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.500
Most don't.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.600
We have the public polling data on it.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:28.230
What most people want is to reform and restructure
the police.

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.900
And I know that there are some on the left,
including in my audience, who get mad and

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.000
they say reform has never worked.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.000
Why would it work now?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.690
Well, we've not actually done it.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.580
And there are police unions that get in the
way of certain reform, elements that are often

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:44.670
recommended and suggested, including a national
bad actors database, that police departments

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:52.600
be mandated to both report to the Bad Actors
database, as well as to use it for reference

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:55.200
when hiring a new police officer.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:59.290
I have multiple segments with ten or twelve
possible specific reforms.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.040
Most people just want to improve policing.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.639
There are situations where you don't need
an armed officer to show up.

00:06:04.639 --> 00:06:08.820
There are situations that are better deescalated
by social workers and others.

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:12.380
But we could also give police officers better
training as social workers.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:13.900
That's another great idea.

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:15.630
Better equip them for de-escalation.

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:21.020
In many countries, police are much better
trained for de-escalation.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.790
None of it requires crackheads, and none of
it requires defunding or canceling the police

